# ACE Design System components

## Components

All UI components must be imported from:

`C:\UX Design\Design System\ds-github`

Never create local components if an equivalent exists there.

If something is missing, flag it in `DESIGN_SYSTEM_GAPS.md` and tell the user — don't improvise.

## Local setup (this repo)

- **Vite/TS alias:** `@ace-ds` → `../../Design System/Design System Sandbox/src`
- **Until `ds-github` is cloned locally**, use the sandbox path above (same ACEDesignSystem repo).
- **Re-export shims** in `src/app/components/ui/` may wrap `@ace-ds` imports so app code keeps stable paths.
- **Tokens:** import `@ace-ds/styles/variables.css` and `typography-tokens.css` in `src/main.tsx`.

## Rules

1. Prefer `@ace-ds/components/...` over new files under `src/app/components/ui/`.
2. Do not change layout, flow, or screen structure when swapping components — API-compatible re-exports only.
3. Known gaps (local shims only): `dialog`, `dropdown-menu`, `select` — see `DESIGN_SYSTEM_GAPS.md`.
